            Building <span class="grad">AI systems</span><br />
            for <em style="font-style:italic;">research</em>.
          </h1>

          <p class="hero__lede reveal reveal-3">
            I fine-tune coding models for population-genetics simulators,
            build local multi-agent CTF solvers, and turn research ideas into
            reproducible infrastructure.
          </p>

          <div class="hero__ctas reveal reveal-4">
            <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#work">
              Explore systems
              <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
            <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/thoughts">
              <span class="mono" style="color:var(--violet);">/</span> journal
            </a>
          </div>

          <dl class="hero__metrics reveal reveal-5">
            <div class="hero__metric">
              <dt class="hero__metric__label">Runs</dt>
              <dd class="hero__metric__value">184</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="hero__metric">
